I am starting to learn **Matplotlib**, a Python library used for creating data visualizations and graphs.

This repository will contain my learning notes, examples, and practice programs as I progress from beginner to advanced concepts.

*Topics I will cover:
- Basic plotting
- Line, Bar, Scatter, and Pie charts
- Customizing graphs
- Labels, titles, and legends
- Subplots
- Working with NumPy and Pandas
- Advanced visualization concepts



